flowchart TD
    A[Exception Occurs] --> B{throw expression}
    B --> C[Stack Unwinding Begins]
    C --> D{Catch handler found?}

    D -->|Yes| E[Execute catch block]
    E --> F[Continue after try-catch]

    D -->|No| G[terminate called]
    G --> H[Abnormal program exit]

    I[Try Block] --> J[Code that may throw]
    J --> K[Catch by value]
    J --> L[Catch by reference]
    J --> M[Catch by pointer]
    J --> N[Catch ... ellipsis]

    O[RAII] --> P[Resources tied to object lifetime]
    P --> Q[Destructor releases resource]
    Q --> R[Safe during stack unwinding]

    S[noexcept] --> T[Function guarantees no throw]
    T --> U[Violation calls terminate]

    V[Exception Hierarchy] --> W[std::exception]
    W --> X[std::runtime_error]
    W --> Y[std::logic_error]
    W --> Z[std::bad_alloc]
    W --> AA[std::bad_cast]
